WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,420
Follow the craftsmanship trade

2
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:02,940
Making money from dead people

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:04,920
Earn favors from living people

4
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,520
We carry the coffin

5
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,020
chasing the corpse

6
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,500
Cross mountains and ridges

7
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:12,550
No matter how difficult the road is

8
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:14,670
